sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Schedule
    participant R as Riftingester
    participant API as OpenRift API
    participant DB as Database

    S->>R: Start synchronisation
    R->>API: GET /cards
    API-->>R: Card catalogue

    alt New or changed data
        R->>DB: Save cards
    else No changes
        Note over R: Skip saving
    end

    R->>DB: Save synchronisation result